# Redirects for Netlify and Cloudflare. Only needed on a redesign, when old addresses
# change: one rule per line, old path, new path, status. Always write 301 explicitly
# (Netlify's default is 301, Cloudflare's is 302).
# www to the address without www is not done here: Netlify does it automatically for the
# primary domain, Cloudflare needs a Redirect Rule (see hosting/cloudflare.md).

/services.html    /#services    301
/contact.html     /#inquiry     301
